// 212 setInterrupt(0, 2100, 1980, "BossCard2"). The HP (lifeMarker 2100) end path is
// carried by the shared invulnerable shell; only the 1980-frame window is reproduced.
// Dependency transcribed here: st03bs.ecl.txt:257-338 Boss2_at.
// Omitted per transcription-policy: segment handover clears (etCancel/etClear/
